    "turn_text": "As this new school year is in full swing and some normalcy is being reestablished, many youth are now turning their attention towards getting back into the routine of in-person education. In season 1 of our finale, episode, we brought on Congressman Jimmy Panetta of California's 20th District, who represents our area in the United States House of Representatives. We look forward to learning about Congressman Panetta's experience with leadership, life in public service, and experience with national policy. It is important for us as youth leaders to learn and be inspired by great leaders and people such as Congressman Panetta.",
